  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When Stop() is called on a VRCAVProVideoPlayer instance after LoadURL() but before OnVideoReady, it doesn't prevent the OnVideoReady callback & the video popping up the screen.\n\nSo currently its:\nLoad('A') -> Stop() -> wait 5 secs -> Load('B') -> ('A' pops up on screen) OnVideoReady('A') called -> ('B' pops up on screen) OnVideoReady('B') called -> END\n\nBut I think something like:\nLoad('A') -> Stop() -> wait 5 secs -> Load('B') -> ('B' pops up on screen) OnVideoReady('B') called -> END\n\nWill make us have more control(?) over the player & no more more unwanted videos popping up.\nThank you.",
